# Large local volume data (T1 raw is 26 MB; not needed for streaming work)
brain-streaming/unity/BrainVolumeSRD/Assets/StreamingAssets/T1/*.raw
brain-streaming/unity/BrainVolumeSRD/Assets/StreamingAssets/T1/*.raw.meta

# Exported fused-volume levels (hb02_L7/L5/L4 .raw) -- regenerate with
# server/tools/zarr_level_to_raw.py or copy manually to the SRD machine.
brain-streaming/unity/BrainVolumeSRD/Assets/StreamingAssets/Fused/*.raw
brain-streaming/unity/BrainVolumeSRD/Assets/StreamingAssets/Fused/*.raw.meta

# Unity crash-recovery scene copies
**/Assets/_Recovery/
**/Assets/_Recovery.meta
brain-streaming/unity/BrainVolumeSRD/.vs
# showcase videos (BrainShowcase F10)
brain-streaming/unity/BrainVolumeSRD/Recordings/
